  message: "Fixed in PR #1913. LoadedCatalogueFile.named marks a file a command-line flag named (--io-primitives, --taint-sources/-sinks/-sanitizers; a directory stands for its YAML files); catalogue_tiers tiers it yours wherever it sits and keeps its git_state. Claims-file extra_catalogs stay in_repo (owner ruling 2026-10-25). Behavioural evidence: test_axiom_falsification.py::TestCatalogueTiers::test_a_flag_named_file_inside_the_repo_is_yours (committed tools/sinks.yaml named by --taint-sinks -> tiers == [yours]) was a strict xfail and now passes unmarked; test_a_flag_named_file_is_disclosed_under_exactly_one_tier holds (no double listing); core test_in_repo_catalogues.py::test_a_flag_named_file_inside_the_repo_is_yours. Mutating the named check away turned both red."  # 2d25
